jet registry — Publish and manage packages
  jet registry publish --to <registry> [--no-sign]              Publish the current package
  jet registry yank <version> [--message <reason>]              Stop new installs of a published version
  jet registry keygen [--registry <name>] [--force]             Create a package-signing key
  jet registry key backup [<dest>] [--registry <name>]          Manage the package-signing key
  jet registry vendor [--vendor-dir <path>]                     Copy dependencies into vendor/
